            {
                "entry_id": "86b60682-918c-3cb3-be07-46dc674072dd",
                "word": "multinationale",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "00dcac9b-7f86-447a-bc9d-9cd17036af73",
                        "entry_id": "86b60682-918c-3cb3-be07-46dc674072dd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "multinationales"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "67894902-2709-3a07-b39a-428ac85457d5",
                        "entry_id": "86b60682-918c-3cb3-be07-46dc674072dd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Entreprise qui a des filiales dans plus d'un pays."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "12e1f66e-0cad-41ae-b590-6e731971b6df",
                                "sense_id": "67894902-2709-3a07-b39a-428ac85457d5",
                                "text": "Pour les radicaux, les multinationales sont des profiteuses de la faim qui jouent un rôle prépondérant dans l’exploitation des pauvres."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "870f4381-118f-48c9-966d-89b60445fc13",
                                "sense_id": "67894902-2709-3a07-b39a-428ac85457d5",
                                "text": "Le député de Jonquière en sait quelque chose, lui-même entouré de multinationales qu’il flatte un jour et qu’il \"déflatte\" le lendemain, mais cela fait partie de la conjoncture politique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "096e0b76-ef9d-4394-80f9-1c3aaac4cfb6",
                                "sense_id": "67894902-2709-3a07-b39a-428ac85457d5",
                                "text": "Le nom de Fiona Scott Morton ne vous dit sans doute rien mais cette spécialiste des multinationales du numérique est à créditer d’un exploit, celui d’avoir soudé contre elle l’écologiste Yannick Jadot et le président du Rassemblement national Jordan Bardella, tous deux eurodéputés."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "332d517c-31ab-4448-8adc-67626c8616a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "86b60682-918c-3cb3-be07-46dc674072dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "67894902-2709-3a07-b39a-428ac85457d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "multinational",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "multinational",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77feea03-fb94-33c4-a7d3-59facbf6f20f",
                                        "entry_id": "34809c2d-e9ae-3e59-b23c-e27361faf04f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, or involving more than two nations (externally between countries or internally in a country)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8766383-9a2f-4485-98d0-3272094ceb76",
                                                "sense_id": "77feea03-fb94-33c4-a7d3-59facbf6f20f",
                                                "text": "AS a young student at the multinational Aramco school in Dhahran, Saudi Arabia, Fadi Jaber, a son of Palestinian refugees, always preferred his American classmates’ cupcakes, brownies and chocolate chip cookies to his mother’s pastries: knafah, qatayef and baklawah."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1319d236-30fa-378c-b70f-4973d9d6171c",
                                        "entry_id": "34809c2d-e9ae-3e59-b23c-e27361faf04f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Operating, or having subsidiary companies in multiple countries (especially more than two)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5c2c312-6a42-4305-99d3-44690400d801",
                                                "sense_id": "1319d236-30fa-378c-b70f-4973d9d6171c",
                                                "text": "By operating within many nations, but ouside them at the same time, multinational firms create possibilities of change even in the world political structure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19f82e6f-a730-4460-a0c0-a5497e776fcb",
                                                "sense_id": "1319d236-30fa-378c-b70f-4973d9d6171c",
                                                "text": "Some managers seemed sympathetic to the study, although they encouraged me to recast it as a technical issue, such as the \"problem of executive succession in multinationals.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "multinational",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "224a40b6-8bec-3f64-b399-4b7c14f4da20",
                                        "entry_id": "eb9227d3-b17f-37f2-9c81-54ca112f4e92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A multinational company."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c968a4d-d4e4-495b-a8d3-84e35223e43a",
                                                "sense_id": "224a40b6-8bec-3f64-b399-4b7c14f4da20",
                                                "text": "The G8 leaders also called on multinationals to make a full disclosure to the taxman over how much tax they pay in different countries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
